调研要回答的核心问题，例如\"现有协同办公平台的日报功能能否满足跨平台自动采集与汇总需求，缺口在哪里\"。目标应可度量、可核","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":321,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"00000011","paragraph_index":8,"start_index":310,"text_preview":"1.2 调研对象与范围","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":406,"paragraph_id":"00000012","paragraph_index":9,"start_index":322,"text_preview":"〔待填：本组选定协同办公类产品的日报 / 汇报功能作为调研对象，候选为飞书、钉钉、企业微信三款。写明入选理由与调研范围边界（只覆盖日报相","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":415,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"00000013","paragraph_index":10,"start_index":407,"text_preview":"1.3 行业定位","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":453,"paragraph_id":"00000014","paragraph_index":11,"start_index":416,"text_preview":"〔待填：简述协同办公行业概况与日报场景在其中的位置，引用来源不少于三个。〕","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":466,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"00000015","paragraph_index":12,"start_index":454,"text_preview":"第 2 章 调研目标分析","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":480,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"00000016","paragraph_index":13,"start_index":467,"text_preview":"2.1 解决用户的什么问题","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":543,"paragraph_id":"00000017","paragraph_index":14,"start_index":481,"text_preview":"〔待填：对照课程项目痛点清单（记忆翻找、多平台粘贴、内容遗漏、协作归属、格式不统一），逐条说明现有产品如何应对、效果如何。〕","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":556,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"00000018","paragraph_index":15,"start_index":544,"text_preview":"2.2 采用的架构与流程","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":615,"paragraph_id":"00000019","paragraph_index":16,"start_index":557,"text_preview":"〔待填：描述被调研产品日报功能的整体流程（数据采集 → 汇总 → 生成 → 推送），可用一张流程图或文字分步说明。〕","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":625,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"0000001A","paragraph_index":17,"start_index":616,"text_preview":"2.3 带来的好处","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":680,"paragraph_id":"0000001B","paragraph_index":18,"start_index":626,"text_preview":"〔待填：归纳现有方案的价值（效率、可追溯、协作透明），同时指出其未解决的缺口——该缺口即本组项目的机会点。〕","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":693,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"0000001C","paragraph_index":19,"start_index":681,"text_preview":"第 3 章 调研内容分析","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":702,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"0000001D","paragraph_index":20,"start_index":694,"text_preview":"3.1 受众用户","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":745,"paragraph_id":"0000001E","paragraph_index":21,"start_index":703,"text_preview":"〔待填：各产品日报功能的目标用户画像（个人 / 团队 / 管理者），使用场景差异。〕","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":756,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"0000001F","paragraph_index":22,"start_index":746,"text_preview":"3.2 核心功能模块","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":806,"paragraph_id":"00000020","paragraph_index":23,"start_index":757,"text_preview":"〔待填：列表对比三款产品的功能模块，如模板管理、定时提醒、数据统计、多端同步、AI 辅助填写等。〕","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":826,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"00000021","paragraph_index":24,"start_index":807,"text_preview":"3.3 UI 风格与核心流程（配截图）","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":898,"paragraph_id":"00000022","paragraph_index":25,"start_index":827,"text_preview":"〔待填：附 3–6 张关键界面截图，每张标注产品名、页面名称与拍摄日期，并配一段文字说明其交互流程与 UI 特点。截图须为小组自行操作截取。〕","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":911,"heading_level":2,"paragraph_id":"00000023","paragraph_index":26,"start_index":899,"text_preview":"第 4 章 调研结论分析","type":"Heading"},{"end_index":921,"heading_level":3,"paragraph_id":"00000024","paragraph_index":27,"start_index":912,"text_preview":"4.1 易用性对比","type":"Heading"},{"col_count":4,"end_index":1049,"first_row_texts":["对比维度","飞书","钉钉","企业微信"],"paragraph_index":28,"row_count":5,"start_index":922,"table_end":1049,"table_id":"0j8q0br8","table_index":2,"table_rows":[{"cells":[{"col":1,"end_index":927,"row":1,"start_index":923,"text_preview":"对比维度"},{"col":2,"end_index":931,"row":1,"start_index":929,"text_preview":"飞书"},{"col":3,"end_index":935,"row":1,"start_index":933,"text_preview":"钉钉"},{"col":4,"end_index":941,"row":1,"start_index":937,"text_preview":"企业微信"}],"row":1},{"cells":[{"col":1,"end_index":949,"row":2,"start_index":944,"text_preview":"填写便捷度"},{"col":2,"end_index":955,"row":2,"start_index":951,"text_preview":"〔待填〕"},{"col":3,"end_index":961,"row":2,"start_index":957,"text_preview":"〔待填〕"},{"col":